  ["Spirit in Physics (Ghost Hacker universe) publishes as a self-sovereign atproto actor (com-etzhayyim-tsumugu): self-issued did:key CACAO + kotobase.net graph, not app-aozora write access"
   "publish topology is relay/pull, not push: downstream consumers (aozora.app first, later X/Instagram/LINE) each independently subscribe to the actor's kotobase.net graph and project it, modeled on kototama.emit's targets map"
   "app-aozora's existing single-owner Bearer==PDS_ADMIN_TOKEN write path is NOT extended with DID verification for this actor; aozora.appview.manga is extended into a poll/subscribe relay instead"]
